{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "赵丽老师经常以班级的名义从个体书店以优惠价购买各科课程学习辅导资料，然后以全价卖给同学，几乎是人手一套。同时，她向学生家长暗示或明要礼物、礼品或礼金，特别是在各种节日的时候。此外，她还私下到本市“光华家教辅导中心”等处兼课。在学校讲课时她会“留有一手”，只讲基本内容，对课程的重点也往往一带而过，并直接或间接地介绍同学去“光华家教辅导中心”等民办课外辅导机构或家教中心接受辅导或参加“补课”。当然，同学接受辅导或参加“补课”是要交高额学费的，“光华家教辅导中心”等处给赵丽老师很多讲课费和介绍费。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3603, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3851, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m1.k3", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m3.k02", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.201.r007", "ntce.outline.201.r008", "ntce.outline.201.r010", "ntce.outline.201.r011", "ntce.outline.201.r018", "ntce.outline.201.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q31"], "word_count": 248, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3603, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3851, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}},