{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q34.material.recovered", "text": "某中学校一位实习老师，教数学。他上课很有趣，但对学生很严格，如果有同学上黑板演示题目做不出题，就会骂人。最严重的一次是，一个学习不好的男同学被教了好几次还做不对，他一怒之下就把人家的头往黑板上撞，用非常粗俗的话骂他。那个男生受不了这样的刺激，最后厌学，不肯再读书了，连高中都没上。34（1）从教师职业道德的角度，分析材料中教师行为存在的问题。（2）从教育法律法规的角度，分析材料中教师行为存在的问题。三、作文题。根据题意要求，回答问题。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4435, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4654, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q34"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m1.k3", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m3.k03", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.ethics", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.201.r007", "ntce.outline.201.r008", "ntce.outline.201.r010", "ntce.outline.201.r011", "ntce.outline.201.r018", "ntce.outline.201.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2011b.q34"], "word_count": 218, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "82cd9e31d7396185e3b013ce6821a49ea5ee7ba68f9439c282a9cf90030eb6d1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4435, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4654, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}